{
  "_id": "tg-crown",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "I took the crown that was upon his head, 2 Sam. 1:10. he took their king’s crown … set on David’s head, 2 Sam. 12:30. king’s son, and put the crown upon him, 2 Kgs. 11:12 (2 Chr. 23:11). hast crowned him with glory and honour, Ps. 8:5 (Heb. 2:9). thou settest a crown of pure gold on his head, Ps. 21:3. profaned his crown by casting it to the ground, Ps. 89:39. crown of glory shall she deliver to thee, Prov. 4:9. virtuous woman is a crown to her husband, Prov. 12:4. prudent are crowned with knowledge, Prov. 14:18. hoary head is a crown of glory, Prov. 16:31. Children’s children are the crown of old men, Prov. 17:6. crown of glory in the hand of the Lord, Isa. 62:3. they shall be as the stones of a crown, Zech. 9:16.",
