    {
      "text": "plaited a crown of thorns, Matt. 27:29 (Mark 15:17; John 19:2). they do it to obtain a corruptible crown, 1 Cor. 9:25. is he not crowned, except he strive lawfully, 2 Tim. 2:5. laid up for me a crown of righteousness, 2 Tim. 4:8. he shall receive the crown of life, James 1:12. receive a crown of glory that fadeth not, 1 Pet. 5:4. I will give thee a crown of life, Rev. 2:10. that no man take thy crown, Rev. 3:11. a crown was given unto him, Rev. 6:2. upon her head a crown of twelve stars, Rev. 12:1. having on his head a golden crown, Rev. 14:14.",
